---
title: "Engine daily loop: one trading session t"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Eng as Run (loop.py)
    participant Cache as YearCache (parquet, 2 years in memory)
    participant View as StoreView as_of t
    participant Cash as cash.py
    participant Fill as fills.py
    participant Settle as settlement.py
    participant Mark as marks.py
    participant Hedge as hedge.py
    participant Strat as Strategy (RollingShortStraddle)
    participant Early as early.py
    participant Led as Ledger
    Eng->>View: step_01_load#58; create the view with as_of = t and the run's split
    Note right of View: A read dated after t raises LookAheadError, and as_of past the split end raises SplitError. Every market read goes through the view#59; the one exception is the session calendar, dates only (D3)
    View->>Cache: slice the rows dated t#58; SPY bar, rates, dividends up to t, and the day tables
    Cache-->>View: option_quotes, quote_iv, expiry_forwards, smile_fits of t
    Eng->>Eng: S_t, r(t) = the last DGS3MO dated before t, dividends paid by t#59; the day's surface, or the previous one copied when t has no usable smile
    Note right of Eng: A copy is counted as stale_surface_days in run_meta.json
    Eng->>Eng: step_02_start_of_day#58; book the early events decided at t-1 (shares at K, cash -/+ 100 K)
    Eng->>Cash: dividends with ex-date t on the shares held#59; interest from t-1 to t on the prior-close cash at r(t-1)#59; borrow fee on short shares
    Cash-->>Eng: signed integer cents, each rounded once#58; cash_flows rows dividend, interest, borrow_fee
    Eng->>Eng: cancel every pending order with a leg on a lot those events removed (LOT_REMOVED)
    Eng->>Eng: step_03_fill#58; a next_open hedge from t-1 trades at today's open#59; share orders fill at this close whatever the snapshot (D15)
    alt snapshot t exists
        Eng->>View: quotes and quote_iv of the legs' contracts at t
        View-->>Eng: bid, ask, quality_flags, volume, IV
        Eng->>Fill: option orders created before t#58; quote state, price in integer cents at mid plus or minus k half-spreads, cap, whole packages, fees
        Fill-->>Eng: fills, and cash_flows option_premium and option_fee#59; a remainder is cancelled (NO_QUOTE, ZERO_BID, ILLIQUID, CAP)
    else no snapshot on t
        Eng->>Eng: option orders wait for the next snapshot
    end
    Eng->>Settle: step_04_settle#58; lots whose settle_date is t, against the SPY close S_t
    Note right of Settle: settle_date is the expiry, or D16's map for the two mapped non-session expiries (2015-12-19 to 12-18, 2018-12-05 to 12-04)#59; any other raises UnmappedExpiry
    Settle-->>Eng: ITM by 0.01 or more#58; shares at K, else expired worthless#59; pin flag#59; expiry_events and cash_flows settlement
    Eng->>Eng: cancel pending orders on the settled lots (LOT_REMOVED, D12)
    opt hedge mode never and shares were delivered
        Eng->>Eng: new_order#58; share_liquidation for the delivered shares, filled at the t+1 close (ADR-0003 section 3, D15)
    end
    Eng->>View: step_05_mark#58; quotes and quote_iv of the open lots' contracts at t
    View-->>Eng: bid, ask, quality_flags, own IV, in_smile
    Eng->>Mark: mark_lots#58; one mark per open lot, plus an INTRINSIC row for each lot settled today, kept out of NAV (D11)
    Note right of Mark: QUOTE_MID, ZERO_BID_MID, else the CRR American price at the surface IV (SURFACE_MODEL#59; STALE_SURFACE with no snapshot). Never a carried last mid
    Mark-->>Eng: mark_price, mark_source, mark_flags (MARK_JUMP, IV_FAIL, GREEKS_OTM_IV), Black-76 greeks, value_mid and value_liq per lot
    Eng->>Hedge: step_06_hedge#58; net delta in shares, delivered shares included#59; due on the schedule or the band, or never
    Note right of Hedge: With hedge_timing next_open the plan is kept and trades at the next open, in step 3. Implemented, but no test exercises it
    alt hedge due
        Hedge-->>Eng: hedge_shares#58; minus round_half_away(net delta), at S_t
        Eng->>Fill: stock_cost_cents#58; commission and slippage, Decimal ROUND_HALF_UP
        Fill-->>Eng: cash_flows hedge_trade, hedge_commission, hedge_slippage#59; a hedges row, a zero-share trade included
    else not due
        Hedge-->>Eng: no trade
    end
    Eng->>Mark: step_07_snapshot#58; NAV_mid, NAV_liq, the model-marked share of gross option value
    Mark-->>Eng: OK, or DEGRADED above 20#37;
    Eng->>Led: daily_pnl row for t (the attribution and margin columns stay null until M5 and M6)
    alt step_08_eod_risk#58; NAV_mid above 0
        Eng->>Strat: step_09_decide#58; decide(view, book.state(t), ctx)
        Note right of Strat: book.state is a frozen copy#58; the strategy cannot move the book
        Strat->>View: forwards and quotes at t, up to as_of only
        View-->>Strat: the chain of t
        Strat-->>Eng: order intents#58; open a short straddle when flat#59; close when DTE at the next session is at most exit_dte (0 holds to expiry)
        Eng->>Eng: check_intent, stamp the order-date volume V_t on each leg, create the orders for t+1
        opt fill_timing is same_close
            Eng->>Fill: pass 9b#58; today's new option orders against snapshot t, stamped t (D17)
            Fill-->>Eng: fills dated t#59; the new lots are marked at t and the daily_pnl row of t is recomputed
        end
        Eng->>Early: step_10_early#58; each open lot not settling today, at the surface IV
        Note right of Early: Calls#58; before a projected ex-date t+1, by the closed form (the lattice with two ex-dates). Puts#58; every day, a pre-filter and then the CRR lattice, N = 500
        Early-->>Eng: exercise or assign at t+1#58; an expiry_events row (early_exercised, early_assigned), booked in step 2 of t+1
        opt hedge mode never and shares will be delivered
            Eng->>Eng: new_order#58; share_liquidation, decided at t, filled at the t+1 close (ADR-0003 section 5)
        end
    else NAV_mid at or below 0 (ruin)
        Eng->>Led: a risk_events row kind ruin, the open positions get exit_reason ruin, the run stops after step 11
    end
    Eng->>Led: step_11_write#58; position_marks rows of t#59; keep the close (cash, shares, NAV, surface, marks) for t+1
    Eng->>Eng: on_session_end(t, book)
    Eng->>Led: run_backtest, after the last session#58; runs, positions, orders, order_legs and lots rows#59; all 12 tables written to a .tmp folder
    Note right of Led: Once per run, not per session. The store is checked again first#58; an input file that changed while the run read it raises StoreChanged and no ledger is written
    Led-->>Eng: SHA-256 of each file in run_meta.json#59; the folder is renamed to runs/run_id=ID, with ID = SHA-256(config_hash, data_fingerprint, commit, code_fingerprint)
